*.log
logs/

# ====== 資料檔案 ======
# 座標快取／中繼檔。注意：server/data/shelter_coordinates.csv 是刻意進版控的
# 產出物（見 server/tool/build_coordinates.dart），不在此排除。
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
data-with-latlng.json
geocode-cache.json

# ====== Flutter / Dart ======
# 同一份規則也寫在 flutter_codefest/.gitignore，
# 讓保護在 repo 被拆分成獨立專案時仍然成立。
flutter_codefest/.dart_tool/
flutter_codefest/.pub/
flutter_codefest/.pub-cache/
flutter_codefest/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
flutter_codefest/build/
flutter_codefest/coverage/
flutter_codefest/**/doc/api/
flutter_codefest/**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
flutter_codefest/app.*.symbols
flutter_codefest/app.*.map.json
flutter_codefest/android/app/debug
flutter_codefest/android/app/profile
flutter_codefest/android/app/release
flutter_codefest/.packages
flutter_codefest/.pub-preload-cache/

# ====== Dart Server ======
server/.dart_tool/
server/.packages
server/build/
server/logs/

# ====== Node.js (相容) ======
node_modules/

# ====== Claude Code 的本機工作指引 ======
# 刻意不進版控：內容是給 AI agent 的操作指引，不是給使用者的專案文件。
# CHANGELOG.md 與 NOTICE.md 必須留在版控中——NOTICE.md 是資料再散布時的
# 來源標示落點，README 與 LICENSE 都指向它。
CLAUDE.md
